{"id":6279,"date":"2018-10-22T20:08:21","date_gmt":"2018-10-22T20:08:21","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/new.sherwoodcharterschool.org\/?page_id=6279"},"modified":"2025-09-05T14:21:19","modified_gmt":"2025-09-05T21:21:19","slug":"giving","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/giving\/","title":{"rendered":"Giving"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><section class=\"l-section wpb_row height_medium\"><div class=\"l-section-h i-cf\"><div class=\"g-cols vc_row type_default valign_top\"><div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column vc_column_container\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column \">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n\t\t\t<h3>Help Support Sherwood Charter School!<\/h3>\n<p>By donating to Sherwood Charter School, you are supporting our mission and providing the learning environment that makes our school unique. With Sherwood Charter School only receiving 80% of traditional public school funding, your support is essential in maintaining a balanced budget and closing the 20% deficiency gap, as well as contributing to what makes our school exceptional. See how you can give below!<\/p>\n\r\n\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"g-cols wpb_row  type_default valign_top vc_inner \"><div class=\"vc_col-sm-4 wpb_column vc_column_container\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column \">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-7298 size-medium aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/SHW_OneFund-ID_horiz-300x164.png\" alt=\"OneFund\" width=\"300\" height=\"164\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/SHW_OneFund-ID_horiz-300x164.png 300w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/SHW_OneFund-ID_horiz-768x419.png 768w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/SHW_OneFund-ID_horiz.png 826w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n\r\n\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n\r\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column \">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n\t\t\t<form action=\"https:\/\/www.paypal.com\/donate\" method=\"post\" target=\"_top\"><input name=\"hosted_button_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"W7NJCFLCQF5TS\" \/><br \/>\n<input title=\"PayPal - The safer, easier way to pay online!\" alt=\"Donate with PayPal button\" name=\"submit\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/donate-button-purple\/\" type=\"image\" \/><br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.paypal.com\/en_US\/i\/scr\/pixel.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" border=\"0\" \/><\/form>\n<p>The OneFund is our annual fundraising campaign. Your tax-deductible contribution provides the opportunity for our students to have learning come to life. Our goal is 100% family involvement every year! Donate now online using the link above, or by mailing your donation to PO Box 1342, Sherwood, OR 97140.<\/p>\n<p><em>Note: To set up an automatic monthly donation, please enter your desired amount in the other box on the donation screen and check the &#8220;Make this a monthly donation&#8221; box.<\/em><\/p>\n\r\n\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"vc_col-sm-4 wpb_column vc_column_container\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column \">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-8337 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/Fred-Meyer-Rewards-Logo-300x225.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"251\" height=\"188\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/Fred-Meyer-Rewards-Logo-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/Fred-Meyer-Rewards-Logo.png 400w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 251px) 100vw, 251px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.fredmeyer.com\/communityrewards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-8339 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/Fred-Meyer-300x76.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"328\" height=\"83\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/Fred-Meyer-300x76.png 300w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/Fred-Meyer.png 765w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 328px) 100vw, 328px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Use your Fred Meyer Rewards card to donate every time you shop at Fred\u2019s.<\/p>\n<p>1) Click link above<br \/>\n2) Follow directions<br \/>\n3) Enter our number when prompted: TP443 or search for Sherwood Charter School.<br \/>\n4) Select us and click save.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\r\n\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"vc_col-sm-4 wpb_column vc_column_container\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column \">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n\t\t\t<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Company Matching<\/strong><\/h2>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\">Make Your Donation Go Further<\/h5>\n<p>Did you know that many employers offer a matching gift program for donations or volunteer hours? Some companies are even qualifying help with distance learning while students are at home with distance learning as volunteer time that can be matched. Check with your employer to see!<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Some examples of local companies with matching programs are:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Intel<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Lam Research<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mentor Graphics<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">PGE<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Microsoft<\/li>\n<li>Nike<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wells Fargo<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Standard Insurance<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Home Depot<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Verizon<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">State Farm<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\r\n\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"w-separator size_medium with_line width_default thick_1 style_solid color_border align_center\"><div class=\"w-separator-h\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column \">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n\t\t\t<h4>Check out some of the activities that you help fund with your donation:<\/h4>\n\r\n\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"w-grid type_grid layout_gallery_default cols_5\" id=\"us_grid_1\"><style id=\"us_grid_1_css\">#us_grid_1 .w-grid-item{padding:4px}#us_grid_1 .w-grid-list{margin:-4px}.w-grid + #us_grid_1 .w-grid-list{margin-top:4px}.l-section.width_full>div>div>.vc_col-sm-12>div>div>#us_grid_1 .w-grid-list{margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px}.l-section.height_auto>div>div>.vc_col-sm-12>div>div>#us_grid_1:first-child .w-grid-list{margin-top:4px}.l-section.height_auto>div>div>.vc_col-sm-12>div>div>#us_grid_1:last-child .w-grid-list{margin-bottom:4px}@media (max-width:767px){#us_grid_1 .w-grid-item{width:25%}}@media (max-width:479px){#us_grid_1 .w-grid-item{width:50%}}<\/style><style>#us_grid_1 .w-grid-item-h{}#us_grid_1 .usg_post_image_1{}#us_grid_1 .usg_post_image_1{transition-duration:0.3s;transform:scale(1) translate(0,0)}#us_grid_1 .w-grid-item-h:hover .usg_post_image_1{transform:scale(1) translate(0,0);opacity:0.5}<\/style><div class=\"w-grid-list\"><article class=\"w-grid-item ratio_1x1 post-6585 attachment type-attachment status-inherit hentry\" data-id=\"6585\">\r\n\t<div class=\"w-grid-item-h\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"w-grid-item-anchor\" href=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/10\/29187238_1950856071897771_6251969453660045312_n-1.jpg\" ref=\"magnificPopupGrid\" title=\"29187238_195085